ProtocolFeeCollector::setMarketRegistry
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new market registry is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when new market registry equals the current registry
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new market registry is valid and different
        ├── it should update marketRegistry
        └── it should emit MarketRegistryUpdated
